# Home Connect — application credentials
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in, or (preferred) mount this path from the "Home
# Connect" 1Password Environment: Desktop app → Environments → Destinations →
# "Local .env file". 1Password then streams the values through a FIFO on
# demand, so the secret is never written to disk.
# https://www.1password.dev/environments/local-env-file
#
# Because it is a FIFO, it yields nothing until 1Password is unlocked and the
# read authorised. The loader in auth.py reads it non-blocking under a deadline
# (ENV_READ_TIMEOUT) and fails with guidance, rather than hanging the recorder
# forever when launchd starts it at boot.
#
# Both values come from the Home Connect developer portal application.
# HOMECONNECT_CLIENT_SECRET is optional: a device-flow client need not be
# confidential, and an empty value is rejected where a missing one is accepted.

HOMECONNECT_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id
HOMECONNECT_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret
